# AdMob ids for a store build. Copy to admob.env (not committed) and fill in.
# Without admob.env every build serves Google's test ads (safe to tap, earns nothing).
#   ADMOB_APP_ID   AdMob > 앱 > 앱 설정 > 앱 ID        (ca-app-pub-…~…, tilde)
#   ADMOB_BANNER   AdMob > 광고 단위 > 배너            (ca-app-pub-…/…, slash)
ADMOB_APP_ID=
ADMOB_BANNER=
